<title>USA: Banknorth Group Q4 net rose.</title>
<headline>Banknorth Group Q4 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Vt. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>				   For the three months ended Dec 31,</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995	Change	 %</p>
<p> NET INCOME		  7,033	5,831	1,202    20.6%</p>
<p> Avg shrs outstanding7,826,648  6,804,425  1,022,223    15.0%</p>
<p> Net per share		0.90	 0.86	 0.04     4.7%</p>
<p>				For the years ended Dec 31,</p>
<p> NET INCOME		 25,390     22,373	3,017    13.5%</p>
<p> Avg shrs outstanding7,703,758  6,804,425    899,333    13.2%</p>
<p> Net per share		3.30	 3.29	 0.01     0.3%</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
